  "id": "cboettig/gbif",
  "title": "H3-Indexed cloud-optimized snapshots of GBIF ",
  "description": "Cloud-optimized, H3-indexed snapshots of GBIF (Global Biodiversity Information Facility) occurrence records \u2014 over 3.4 billion global biodiversity observations from the 2026-06 snapshot, deduplicated and partitioned by H3 resolution-0 hexagon with hex indices at resolutions 0-10. Includes derived products: per-hexagon taxonomic aggregation counts, a spatial join of occurrences with historical US redlining ('Mapping Inequality') polygons, and a reference taxa list.",
